f33_frac_vacask_dec2p4: VACASK `mode="dec" points=2.4` from 1k to 100k runs 2 per decade (1000, 3162.28, ..., 100000: 5 points): points truncates
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
load "spice/capacitor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
model capacitor sp_capacitor
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=0.0 mag=1.0
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
c1 (out 0) capacitor c=1u
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  analysis ac1 ac from=1k to=100k mode="dec" points=2.4
endc
